  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Marcus Frozenblade, the firstborn son of a once-mighty house, carries
    the weight of a noble lineage now diminished. The Frozenblade family, once seated
    in power and respect, was cast aside after the fall of the old regime, slowly
    fading from the Empire\u2019s inner circle. Yet, a prophecy whispers of a Frozenblade
    who will rise to reclaim the glory of their ancestors\\n\\nDriven by an unshakable
    sense of honor, Marcus dedicates his life to restoring his family's lost prestige."
